{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    " %lld of them use tricks the older loader could not handle; the native runtime handles those too, except for optional anti-tamper code, which it leaves out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 其中有 %1$lld 个使用了旧加载器无法处理的技巧；原生运行时也能处理这些，但会跳过可选的防篡改代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Built-in StikJIT needs iOS 26, LocalDevVPN, and a pairing file, which Husk can make itself on iOS 27.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 内置 StikJIT 需要 iOS 26、LocalDevVPN 以及一个配对文件；在 iOS 27 上 Husk 可以自行生成配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Husk turns the screen the way the game asks for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Husk 会按游戏的要求旋转屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " It is a landscape game: Husk turns the screen for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 这是一款横屏游戏：Husk 会为它旋转屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %@ left": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · 剩余 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %@/s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · %1$@/秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · %lld/%lld files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · %1$lld/%2$lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@  ·  %@  ·  %@ elapsed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@  ·  %2$@  ·  已用时 %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (web app)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@（网页应用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Orientation and resolution apply the next time the game starts, and a game already running in this session needs Husk closed and opened again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 方向和分辨率会在下次游戏启动时生效；本次会话中已在运行的游戏需要关闭并重新打开 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ downloaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已下载 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ free on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备剩余 %1$@ 可用空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has been started in this run of Husk. Close Husk and open it again to restore saves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已在本次 Husk 运行中启动过。请关闭并重新打开 Husk 以恢复存档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is still loaded and only one game can run per session. Husk closes; open it again and %@ starts by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 仍处于已载入状态，每次会话只能运行一款游戏。Husk 将关闭；重新打开后 %2$@ 会自动启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is still loaded, and a game cannot be unloaded once it has started. Close Husk with the button above, then open it again to play %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 仍处于已载入状态，游戏一旦启动就无法卸载。请用上方按钮关闭 Husk，然后重新打开以游玩 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ / %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ opens by itself once Android has started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓启动后 %1$@ 会自动打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was started in this session, and a game cannot be unloaded once it has started. Close Husk completely and open it again to run %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已在本次会话中启动，游戏一旦启动就无法卸载。请完全关闭 Husk 再重新打开，以运行 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was started in this session. Close Husk completely and open it again to run %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已在本次会话中启动。请完全关闭 Husk 再重新打开，以运行 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld DEX file(s), %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 个 DEX 文件，%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 个应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld controllers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 个手柄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld downloading%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 个正在下载%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld frame(s) drawn · native runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已绘制 %1$lld 帧 · 原生运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld frame(s) posted · driving lifecycle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已提交 %1$lld 帧 · 正在驱动生命周期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min · first boot takes 5–15 min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 分钟 · 首次启动需 5–15 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld relocations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 处重定位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld shared code/data pages": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 个共享代码/数据页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld system calls": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 次系统调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld thread-register reads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线程寄存器读取 %1$lld 次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 pixel per point. Fastest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 1 像素，速度最快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.5 pixels per point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 1.5 像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 pixels per point. The default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 2 像素，默认选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A %@ game. It runs through Husk's native runtime, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一款 %1$@ 游戏。它通过 Husk 的原生运行时运行，运行时会自行加载它的 %2$lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Flutter app. Its engine and its compiled Dart run natively through Husk's translation layer, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一款 Flutter 应用。它的引擎和编译后的 Dart 通过 Husk 的翻译层原生运行，翻译层会自行加载它的 %1$lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup is a .zip of everything %@ has saved in Husk, to keep in Files or move to another device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份是一个 .zip，包含 %1$@ 在 Husk 中保存的全部内容，可保存在“文件”中或转移到其他设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom resolution sets the shape itself, so this does nothing while it is on. Type a wide size for landscape.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义分辨率会自行决定画面形状，因此开启该项时此设置无效。横屏请输入较大的宽度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A jailbreak was found. Turn on Allow JIT in Apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已检测到越狱。请打开“允许 App 使用 JIT”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pairing file made on a computer lets Husk talk to this %@ the same way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上生成的配对文件，可让 Husk 以同样的方式与你的 %1$@ 通信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ANDROID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ANDROID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. Split sets — a base APK plus its config pieces — must be picked together; installing the base alone fails on missing native libraries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 可通过资料库的 + 按钮或“文件”标签页安装。分包应用（一个基础 APK 加若干配置包）必须一起选择；只装基础包会因缺少原生库而失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ATTEMPT LOG": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于本应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent Colour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强调色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activating system packages": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在激活系统软件包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Repositories": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用的软件源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Geometry Dash First": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先添加 Geometry Dash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加软件源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Game or App": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加游戏或应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a game with the + button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 + 按钮添加游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a link to an APK or a file, or the address a computer gives you when it shares a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 APK 或文件的链接，也可以填写电脑共享文件夹时给出的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a source to start discovering apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加软件源后即可开始发现应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Husk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加到 Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your first game": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加你的第一个游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added to the library": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加到资料库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在添加 %1$@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %lld APKs…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在添加 %1$lld 个 APK…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. Android cannot be saved while this is on, so every launch boots from cold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加声音设备。开启后无法保存安卓系统，因此每次启动都会冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be saved — QEMU refuses to snapshot a machine with one — so every launch boots from cold. Turning it on or off costs a cold boot either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加声音设备。在它连接期间无法保存安卓系统——QEMU 拒绝对带声卡的机器做快照——因此每次启动都会冷启动。无论开启还是关闭，都会触发一次冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次下载会增加约 2 GB。它是在软件渲染器下抓取的，因此在 GPU 模式下不会使用——GPU 模式会冷启动一次并自行保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Almost worth the wait": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待是值得的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An APK is added to your library when it finishes. Anything else goes into the Shared Storage folder, which games see as their phone storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 完成后会加入资料库；其他文件则进入“共享存储”文件夹，游戏会把它当作手机存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Android app. Husk runs its code on its own Java runtime and loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一款安卓应用。Husk 用自带的 Java 运行时运行它的代码，并自行加载它的 %1$lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Android app. Husk runs its code on its own Java runtime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一款安卓应用。Husk 用自带的 Java 运行时来运行它的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android App Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓应用信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Libraries Used": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调用的安卓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. StikJIT is built into Husk and is the recommended way: it turns JIT on from inside the app, with no computer and no other app. StikDebug and TrollStore work too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓与翻译层游戏都需要 JIT，而在 iOS 上只有已连接的调试器才能授予 JIT。StikJIT 已内置于 Husk，是推荐方式：无需电脑、无需其他应用，直接在 App 内开启 JIT。StikDebug 和 TrollStore 也可以使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓与翻译层游戏都需要 JIT。内置于 Husk 的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps, on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上运行安卓应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓一旦运行就无法改变屏幕形状，因此竖屏画面里的横屏游戏会被压缩成中间一条、显得很小。把它设为横屏是填满屏幕的唯一办法——竖屏应用则会反过来加黑边。需冷启动一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓通过 Metal 调用真实 GPU，帧率约为软件渲染的四倍。这是默认选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android init, first stage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓 init 第一阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android init, second stage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓 init 第二阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓直接从文件所在位置安装，不会复制任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓启动完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %@ gets one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择你的 %1$@ 获取调试器的方式。安卓需要可写入并运行的内存，在 iOS 上只有已连接的调试器才能授予。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓通过 QEMU 自有网络上的一张虚拟以太网卡访问互联网。你手机所在网络中的设备看不到客户机，客户机也看不到它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps Husk cannot run directly, like Termux or app stores.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓以完整模拟方式运行，因此比翻译层上的游戏慢。适用于 Husk 暂时无法直接运行的应用，例如 Termux 或应用商店。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android update ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓更新已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓将冷启动一次，随后保存一个新的快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will get": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓将获得"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓原生代码对处理器和内存提出的一些要求，只有真机才能满足——最重要的是：库代码能否在其数据可写且紧邻的情况下运行。请先开启 JIT，否则会跳过内存检查。检查结果也会输出到控制台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another game": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一款游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another game is already loaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已载入另一款游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App by Levi": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作者 Levi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App reports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps and games open in a window you can move, resize and minimise to a dock, like LiveContainer's multitasking. Each app can override this in its own settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用和游戏会在可移动、可缩放、可最小化到停靠栏的窗口中打开，类似 LiveContainer 的多任务。每个应用都可在自己的设置中覆盖此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Architecture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "架构"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Architectures": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "架构"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about Android updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "询问是否更新安卓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach the sound device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接声音设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorizing Google Play session…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在授权 Google Play 会话…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic follows the system appearance — light, dark and tinted. The others pin one look. iOS shows its own confirmation after a change; that alert cannot be turned off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“自动”跟随系统外观——浅色、深色与着色；其他选项固定为一种外观。更改后 iOS 会弹出自己的确认框，该提示无法关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic offers the controller for games that cannot be played without one (Unreal Engine games), when no real controller is connected. Always offers it for any game that understands one. A paired controller is always used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当未连接真实手柄时，“自动”会为必须用手柄才能玩的游戏（如 Unreal Engine 游戏）提供手柄；对任何支持手柄的游戏则始终提供。已配对的手柄会始终优先使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back Up Saves": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份存档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to Husk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回 Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up a game's saves to a .zip from its page, and restore them later or on another device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在游戏页面把存档备份为 .zip，之后可在本机或其他设备上恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bad APK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 损坏"
          }
        }
      }
