    "Geode is the mod loader for Geometry Dash. With it on, Husk downloads Geode for this version of the game, and mods are found and installed in the game itself, from Geode's button on the main menu. Applies the next time the game starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geode 是 Geometry Dash 的模组加载器。开启后，Husk 会为该版本游戏下载 Geode；你可在游戏主菜单的 Geode 按钮中查找并安装模组。下次启动游戏时生效。"
          }
