          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk %@ Is Available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk %1$@ 已可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk %@ is out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk %1$@ 已发布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk closed while the game was running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏运行期间 Husk 被关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not copy it: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 无法复制它：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk couldn't reach this device. Connect LocalDevVPN, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 无法连接到此设备。请连接 LocalDevVPN 后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so Husk tests both rather than assuming.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 需要可写入并执行的内存，在 iOS 上这需要已连接的调试器。有两种途径：一是响应陷入请求的调试器，二是 MAP_JIT 内存映射（内核允许任何被调试的进程使用）。满足其一即可——具体哪种可用取决于设备和 iOS 版本，因此 Husk 会两种都测试，而不是凭空假设。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk pretends to be a computer on your Wi-Fi, and your %@ pairs with it the way it would with a Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 会在你的 Wi‑Fi 上模拟一台电脑，你的 %1$@ 会像与 Mac 配对一样与它配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 会恢复已保存的机器而不是重新启动，只需数秒而非数分钟。写入时画面会静止。关闭此项后不会自动保存任何内容——包括安装之后。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs a real Android system and opens APKs inside it. A few questions first — all of them can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 运行一个真实的安卓系统并在其中打开 APK。先回答几个问题——之后都可以在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows Husk's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 在你 iPhone 上的真实安卓系统中运行未经修改的安卓 APK。控制台会显示 Husk 的实时日志、客户机的串口输出以及 QEMU 自身的输出——这里的任何问题都靠这三类信息来诊断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk was marked as debugged when it opened, so JIT is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 打开时已被标记为正在调试，因此 JIT 已开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use StikDebug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 将使用 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use TrollStore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 将使用 TrollStore。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's Android runtime is about 760 MB. Android itself follows once it is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 的安卓运行时约为 760 MB。安装后还需下载安卓系统本体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT script is missing from this installation. Reinstall Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前安装缺少 Husk 的 JIT 脚本。请重新安装 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's helper reaches this %@'s debugging service through a local VPN. Nothing leaves your %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 的助手通过本地 VPN 访问此 %1$@ 的调试服务，任何内容都不会离开你的 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If JIT is not on when Android starts, Husk turns it on with the method you chose, or walks you through setting one up. You can change it any time in Settings › JIT & sideload.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果安卓启动时 JIT 未开启，Husk 会用你选择的方式开启它，或引导你完成设置。你可随时在“设置 › JIT 与侧载”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入"
          }
        }
      }
