    "In TrollStore's Settings, turn on URL Scheme. TrollStore ignores enable-jit requests without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 TrollStore 的设置中打开“URL Scheme”。没有它，TrollStore 会忽略开启 JIT 的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a window, %@ runs over Husk: move it by its title bar, resize it from the corner, and minimise it to the dock at the edge of the screen while you use the rest of Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在窗口中，%1$@ 运行在 Husk 之上：可拖动标题栏移动、从角落缩放，并可在使用 Husk 其他功能时最小化到屏幕边缘的停靠栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
