    "Nothing is saved, so Android boots from cold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有任何已保存内容，安卓将冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was recorded, which usually means iOS ended Husk for using too much memory, or Husk was closed from the app switcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有记录到任何内容，这通常意味着 iOS 因 Husk 占用内存过多而结束了它，或 Husk 被从应用切换器中关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂无内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Husk detaches StikDebug as soon as the JIT region is held, because a debugger that iOS has suspended stops the whole app the next time it is needed. Turn this on only to collect StikDebug's own logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。一旦获得 JIT 内存区域，Husk 就会断开 StikDebug，因为被 iOS 挂起的调试器会在下次需要时导致整个 App 停止。仅在需要收集 StikDebug 自身日志时开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a computer, make this %@'s pairing file with the [StikDebug pairing-file guide](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上，按照 [StikDebug 配对文件指南](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md) 生成此 %1$@ 的配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a device jailbroken with Dopamine, JIT is a setting: the jailbreak marks every app as debugged when it opens, and a debugged app may run code it wrote. Husk needs nothing else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在使用 Dopamine 越狱的设备上，JIT 只是一个设置：越狱会在每个 App 打开时将其标记为正在调试，被调试的 App 可以运行自己写入的代码。Husk 无需其他操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a jailbroken device JIT is a setting. In Dopamine, turn on Allow JIT in Apps, then open Husk again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在越狱设备上，JIT 是一个设置。在 Dopamine 中打开“允许 App 使用 JIT”，然后重新打开 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
