      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves the machine once Android settles, so later launches restore in seconds instead of booting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓稳定后保存机器，之后启动只需数秒恢复，无需重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves, settings and caches the game made here are deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏在此创建的存档、设置和缓存都将被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saving closes apps but leaves Android's framework running, so the network still works after a restore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存会关闭应用，但保留安卓框架运行，因此恢复后网络仍可使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saving keeps Android exactly as it is, so the next start skips booting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存会完整保留安卓当前状态，下次启动可跳过启动过程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saving stops the framework too. Clears every GPU resource, which is steadier — but the network may not come back until a cold boot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存也会停止框架，并清除所有 GPU 资源，这样更稳定——但在冷启动之前网络可能无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
