    },
    "Starting Android…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动安卓…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting Husk's JIT helper…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动 Husk 的 JIT 助手…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting system services": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动系统服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting the Android runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动安卓运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting the Linux kernel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动 Linux 内核"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting the display server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动显示服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动 · %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is a separate app that attaches to Husk. Husk sends it the JIT script itself, so nothing needs configuring for Husk inside StikDebug.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 是一个会附加到 Husk 的独立 App。Husk 会自行把 JIT 脚本发送给它，因此无需在 StikDebug 中为 Husk 做任何配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it to turn JIT on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 StikDebug，Husk 将打开它来开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 StikDebug，Husk 将打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is not installed. Install it, or set up Built-in StikJIT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 StikDebug。请安装它，或设置内置 StikJIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug, TrollStore and a jailbreak were not found, so Husk will use its built-in helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未找到 StikDebug、TrollStore 或越狱，Husk 将使用其内置助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT is built in — the recommended way": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置 StikJIT——推荐方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT is built into Husk. You can turn JIT on right here — no computer and no other app. Games and Android both need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT 已内置于 Husk。你可直接在这里开启 JIT——无需电脑、无需其他应用。游戏和安卓都需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped. Open Husk to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止。打开 Husk 重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "商店"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success: The guest drew frames!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "成功：客户机已绘制画面！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching games": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own screen stays dark either way — it is a picture of another phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随手机：白天浅色、夜间深色。无论哪种方式，客户机自身的屏幕都保持深色——它显示的是另一台手机的画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tablet — 1280 × 800": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平板 — 1280 × 800"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Check setup**. Husk checks LocalDevVPN and prepares the Developer Disk Image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点**检查设置**。Husk 会检查 LocalDevVPN 并准备开发者磁盘映像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Choose pairing file** and pick it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点**选择配对文件**并选取它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Connect LocalDevVPN**. It switches the VPN on and come straight back to Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点**连接 LocalDevVPN**。它会开启 VPN 并立即返回 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Enable JIT**. Husk's helper attaches and Android can start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点**启用 JIT**。Husk 的助手会附加，随后安卓即可启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to turn on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点以开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap with three fingers to show the interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三指轻点以显示界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teaching an iPhone to speak Android": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "教 iPhone 听懂安卓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical Details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "技术详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: library reports, device checks and run logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安卓翻译层界面中的技术详情：库报告、设备检查和运行日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a remote pairing file. Make one with the StikDebug pairing-file guide and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那不是远程配对文件。请按照 StikDebug 配对文件指南生成一个后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app called %@, a system function Husk does not provide yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用调用了 %1$@，这是 Husk 尚未提供的系统函数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app crashed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用崩溃了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app needs a part of Android that Husk's runtime does not provide yet: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用需要 Husk 运行时尚未提供的一部分安卓功能：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app refused to run here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用拒绝在此运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end of the log from the last time the game started. Share it when reporting a problem.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏上次启动时日志的最后部分。反馈问题时可分享它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first check downloads and mounts Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次检查会下载并挂载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first full release.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首个正式版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game and everything it saved here are deleted from Husk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏及其在此保存的所有内容都将从 Husk 中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game crashed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏崩溃了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game exited": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is loaded in this session. Close Husk completely and open it again to reset its data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已在本次会话中载入。请完全关闭 Husk 再重新打开，以重置其数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏启动时画面上没有任何遮挡：没有工具栏、没有手柄、没有性能读数。三指同时轻点可唤回工具栏，再次轻点可隐藏。游戏中工具栏上的“隐藏”按钮作用相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper did not attach within 90 seconds. Check that LocalDevVPN is connected, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手在 90 秒内未能附加。请确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library marks each game with how it did last time: it plays, it crashed, or it did not start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "资料库会标注每个游戏上次的运行情况：可运行、曾崩溃或未能启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该列表会写入磁盘，因此在安卓完成启动前就会显示在屏幕上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other game": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一款游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对文件会保留在 Husk 的文稿文件夹中，且只会发送给 Husk 自己的助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面在机器启动时生成，因此更改需要一次冷启动，下次保存会替换旧尺寸下保存的机器——再改回来又需一次。尺寸会取整为 8 的倍数。尺寸越大越慢：每个像素都由模拟的手机绘制。安卓的显示密度不随画面改变，因此更大的画面显示的内容更多，而不是内容变大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按顺序排列的实现计划见 Husk 源码中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告包含那次运行的完整日志以及所用设备和构建版本。除非你主动分享，否则不会发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime could not start it. The report says which part was missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行时无法启动它。报告会说明缺少了哪个部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to %@. Unmodified APKs install from here too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们会放入 %1$@，未经修改的 APK 也可从这里安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This APK has no 64-bit code Husk can run, so it will probably not start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 APK 没有 Husk 可运行的 64 位代码，因此很可能无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from Husk's store.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用以多个部分（分包 APK）发布，而只导入了基础包，因此缺少库或资源。请导入完整捆绑包（.apks、.xapk 或 .apkm），或从 Husk 的商店获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app relies on Google Play services (Google sign-in, Google's account and device checks) for more than Husk can answer for. Apps that only use Google's libraries run; this one stops without the real services.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用对 Google Play 服务（Google 登录、Google 账号与设备校验）的依赖超出了 Husk 能模拟的范围。仅使用 Google 库的应用可以运行；而此应用没有真正的服务就会停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Husk's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备关闭了连接，通常意味着它不再接受 Husk 的配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is jailbroken, so JIT comes from the jailbreak's Allow JIT in Apps setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备已越狱，因此 JIT 来自越狱的“允许 App 使用 JIT”设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次安装在后台最多只能等待约 30 秒，请立即前往设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here (or in Geometry Dash's settings, under Mods), then start Geometry Dash and use Geode's button on its main menu to get mods. This APK supplies a library Geode needs, so keep it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Geode 的安卓启动器。在 Husk 上，Geode 改为在 Geometry Dash 内部运行：在这里开启它（或在 Geometry Dash 设置的“模组”中开启），然后启动 Geometry Dash，用主菜单上的 Geode 按钮获取模组。此 APK 提供了 Geode 所需的一个库，请保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a whole operating system — be patient": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一整个操作系统——请耐心等待"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This was removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项已被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted Dark": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "着色深色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted Light": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "着色浅色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tints buttons, switches and selected states throughout the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为整个 App 的按钮、开关和选中状态着色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To send a whole folder from a computer on the same Wi‑Fi, run this on it and enter the address it shows:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要从同一 Wi‑Fi 下的电脑发送整个文件夹，请在电脑上运行以下命令，并输入它显示的地址："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch always works. A gamepad and a pointer are not wired through to Android yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控始终可用。手柄和指针尚未接入安卓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch is always on. The keyboard and the rotate control are in the pill at the bottom of the guest's screen; a gamepad and a pointer are not wired through yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控始终开启。键盘和旋转控件位于客户机屏幕底部的胶囊条中；手柄和指针尚未接入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translating arm64, one block at a time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐块转译 arm64 指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation Layer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trap servicer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "陷入服务程序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore can enable JIT for apps it installed, with no pairing file, VPN or computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore 可为它安装的 App 启用 JIT，无需配对文件、VPN 或电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore can turn JIT on for Husk: it opens Husk and enables it, with no computer. In TrollStore's Settings, URL Scheme must be on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore 可为 Husk 开启 JIT：它会打开 Husk 并启用，无需电脑。TrollStore 设置中的“URL Scheme”必须打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore could not be opened. Install Husk through TrollStore, or choose another method.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开 TrollStore。请通过 TrollStore 安装 Husk，或选择其他方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore did not enable JIT. In TrollStore's Settings turn on URL Scheme, and make sure Husk was installed through TrollStore (or is signed with get-task-allow).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TrollStore 未能启用 JIT。请在 TrollStore 设置中打开“URL Scheme”，并确认 Husk 是通过 TrollStore 安装的（或以带 get-task-allow 的方式签名）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore is installed, so Husk will ask it to enable JIT.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 TrollStore，Husk 将请求它启用 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 TrollStore。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore was not found on this %@. Husk can only use it once it is installed and Husk was installed through it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 %1$@ 上未找到 TrollStore。只有安装了 TrollStore 且 Husk 是通过它安装的，才能使用该方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
