          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for TrollStore to enable JIT…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 TrollStore 启用 JIT…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the helper to attach…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待助手附加…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待你的 %1$@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waking Android up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在唤醒安卓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch It Start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观看它启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What %@ has saved now is replaced by the backup. Back up first if you want to keep it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 当前的存档将被备份替换。若想保留现有存档，请先备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the game is called in Husk. The game itself is not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏在 Husk 中显示的名称，不会更改游戏本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New in Husk %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk %1$@ 新功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a game takes Husk down, the next launch says what happened and gives you a report to share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当游戏导致 Husk 退出时，下次启动会说明发生了什么，并提供可分享的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a new Android image or snapshot is published, Husk asks once whether to download it. Never asked before Android has been downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当有新的安卓镜像或快照发布时，Husk 会询问一次是否下载。在下载安卓之前不会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever Android or a game starts, Husk asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Husk, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每当安卓或游戏启动时，Husk 会请求 TrollStore 启用 JIT。TrollStore 会打开 Husk、短暂附加后释放，使其被允许运行自己写入的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever Android starts, Husk opens StikDebug, which attaches and comes back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
